{"data":[{"author_id":"1870818143071059968","created_at":"2026-11-04T01:30:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2117791439757144421"],"id":"2117791439757144421","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2137,"like_count":20,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":1},"text":"我发现中国人一开口就是 i think 但是外国人开头用and so，the thing is","url":"https://x.com/0xTheo520/status/2117791439757144421"},{"author_id":"1870818143071059968","created_at":"2026-11-04T01:00:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2117783890878161234"],"id":"2117783890878161234","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2499,"like_count":9,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":0},"text":"都在吐槽地铁可以结婚，医院可以结婚的时候，难道没有人羡慕这两个地点负责婚姻登记的工作人员吗？一天到晚基本没什么工作量啊，这很爽诶","url":"https://x.com/0xTheo520/status/2117783890878161234"},{"author_id":"1870818143071059968","created_at":"2026-11-04T00:30:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2117776341265273159"],"id":"2117776341265273159","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":13,"impression_count":19110,"like_count":556,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":31,"retweet_count":8},"text":"为什么我觉得23岁在国外听起来好像很年轻，还有大把前途的样子，在国内语境就听起来已经是做什么都来不及的年纪了","url":"https://x.com/0xTheo520/status/2117776341265273159"},{"author_id":"1870818143071059968","created_at":"2026-11-04T00:00:01.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2117768794147799342"],"id":"2117768794147799342","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":33,"impression_count":25110,"like_count":728,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":13,"retweet_count":5},"text":"我在看黄文，里面有一个片段写到主角的亲戚八十年代末在北京读大学，刚上大学不久就死掉了\n\n主角听到之后心想“我好像知道是怎么死的了”\n\n写黄文也不忘牢记8964，作者太有觉悟了","url":"https://x.com/0xTheo520/status/2117768794147799342"},{"author_id":"1870818143071059968","created_at":"2026-11-03T15:59:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2117647741496999958"],"id":"2117647741496999958","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":8330,"like_count":146,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":7,"retweet_count":0},"text":"我爸跟我说韩国以前有个总统是独裁然后管的特别严，还把宪法改成可以无限连任。最后被暗杀死掉